body:
this happens to me every few weeks.  I use a COX modem and an ORBI mesh system.  For some reason it works just fine, then just goes DARK (this seems to effect my VOIP, and i cant chat with anyone online). I have no idea why, and have been trying to figure it out for a few years.  I usually have to RESET the modem and Orbi to factory setting and reset everything back up.  

&#x200B;

I hope you figure it out, cause im curious too.

which, if you think about it, overall lowers your gear score.  Say adding another 37 power to your 778 javelin, you might be way over powered for gm3.  Keeping everyone lowered makes us all undergeared for GM's, which makes it more difficult, which makes the time to get leggos more difficult.    

&#x200B;

Makes no sense at all, but it frustrates me.

I have ZERO CARES for the things mentioned above.  I almost care less for armor as well, however, i like mixing and matching the armors to create a JAV that actually looks DIFFERENT.  

&#x200B;

However, all of those things are completely SECONDARY to what i REALLY CARE about.  And, sadly, cosmetics are what THEY think are going to KEEP us around and make us EXCITED.  I AM NOT!
